201960, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}, "P13": {"number": 13, "html_dir": "dist/post/13.html", "labels": ["技术"], "post_title": "覆盖6：MathJax 公式", "post_url": "post/13.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 105, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "<script>MathJax = {tex: {inlineMath: [[\"$\", \"$\"]]}};</script><script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>", "head": "", "description": "验证 MathJax 行内与块级公式。", "created_at": 1791202046, "created_date": "2026-10-05", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1791202046, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}}, "single_list": {"P4": {"number": 4, "html_dir": "dist/about.html", "labels": ["about"], "post_title": "关于", "post_url": "about.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 175, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "## 关于本站\n\n这是使用 [InterNote](https://github.com/interset-wq/InterNote) 搭建的个人博客，以 GitHub Issue 为写作入口。", "created_at": 1790732179, "created_date": "2026-09-30", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1790732179, "updated_date": "2026-09-30"}}, "render_cache": {"7c467ea3a2b2c9baf530085fcb60daf0e2d040850a1b60e1a7a94ff3f7ab2b43": "<p>验证 MathJax 行内与块级公式。</p>\n<p>行内：质能方程 <math-renderer class=\"js-inline-math\" style=\"display: inline-block\" data-run-id=\"4b62d68bad9c48411af402181f37409f\">$E = mc^2$</math-renderer>。</p>\n<p>块级：</p>\n<p><math-renderer class=\"js-display-math\" style=\"display: block\" data-run-id=\"4b62d68bad9c48411af402181f37409f\">$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} e^{-x^2} , dx = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$</math-renderer></p>"}}